{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/117","id":4523239857,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABDZspsQ","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/117","diff_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/117.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/117.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/117","number":117,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: formalize Orabona Chapter 1 foundations and causal mean-prediction guarantees","user":{"login":"jicheng9617","id":74550583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617","html_url":"https://github.com/jicheng9617","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Chapter 1 previously had no source-aligned proof route. This candidate adds the actual strict-past mean predictor with initial prediction 1/2, Be-the-Leader, unique empirical-mean minimization, and Theorem 1.3's 4 + 4 log T best-fixed regret bound. It also formalizes comparator/no-regret semantics, the actual asymptotic corollary, and the IID squared-loss benchmark with derived information and integrability conditions. All mappings reference the shared Lean registry.\n\nThis is stacked on PR #116 (`codex/research-online-ogd`, exact dependency 73062790d5cf7b12c5d3c189a053270e993f1a68), which has not been merged. It preserves the fixed-step OGD contracts. The 16-chapter coverage ledger marks later chapters unenumerated; no whole-book completion is claimed.\n\nValidation: local public root/Tests passed (8998 jobs), including nondegenerate deterministic and fair-two-point probability canaries; 24 frozen interfaces and nine definition/import contexts match. Axiom audits contain only propext, Classical.choice, and Quot.sound. Registry tests and site checks passed. Source review and repair records are in runs/online-book-20260914.\n\nThe resumed complete local harness passed all 423 tests with seven existing skips after the execution environment changed. No failing test was changed, removed or mocked; the earlier nine errors remain in full-gate-01.log. Frozen source hashes, contracts, dependency graph and the resumed site checks pass. Chapter 1 is accepted locally; remote CI is tracked separately. No merge or deployment is requested by this draft.\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:41:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:49:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9701f8d1dfed7a0b316c91964ab56dbdfddd9c1c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/117/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/117/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/117/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/f1c623af48c8da6082a8cd93cad47ee2fbdf0351"